                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-05-17T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 17, 1926—3
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>99. Authority requested in Paragraph 3 of your No. 208, May 14, 7 p.m.
                    granted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
